  "description": "The Voopoo Doric Galaxy S1 sets a new standard in portable vaping with its advanced features and ergonomic design. Powered by an 800mAh built-in battery and capable of delivering up to 16W, this kit is designed to provide a full day's vaping with consistent, rich flavour and ample vapour. The kit includes a newly designed 0.7Ω cartridge, which offers a smoother vaping experience and enhances flavour preservation, thanks to its dual air-inlet structure and reduced e-liquid oxidation. Compact yet powerful, the Doric Galaxy S1 weighs just 31.5g and is as easy to carry or slip into a pocket. It features a soft silicone drip tip tailored to fit comfortably between your lips, enhancing the ergonomic feel. With a practical side-filling system, maintaining and refilling your kit is hassle-free and straightforward. The innovative EM-LOCK system prevents leakage, ensuring a clean and efficient vaping experience, while the smart LED indicator keeps you informed about battery status. Whether you're at home or on the go, the Doric Galaxy S1 is an excellent companion for anyone seeking a reliable and stylish vaping solution. When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. We recommend using 50/50 (freebase) or Nic Salts E-Liquid with this kit. Please note: Charging cable is not supplied. A USB-C Charging Cable can be purchased separately.",
